ForgeFlow scored path is offline: pnpm test, pnpm demo:mock, pnpm eval.

Keep the intentional draft_pr failure on attempt 1. demo:mock must print repairs=1 and verdict pass.

Verifier coverage is exact substring of tool output. High-severity issues must be cited. Checklist gates: tests, docs, risk, rollback.

Do not commit secrets, .env, or recordings. pnpm demo uses the OpenAI Responses API when OPENAI_API_KEY is set and falls back to the offline mock otherwise. pnpm demo:mock is the deterministic scored path.

MCP server: pnpm exec tsx src/mcp-server/index.ts. Do not write protocol logs to stdout.
